<%# The one place an AI-tool failure is drawn.
    It used to be built as a String inside the controller and handed to
    `turbo_stream.update(target, html: "<p …>")`, which renders through
    ActionView::Template::HTML and ESCAPES a plain String — so the student read
    `<p style='color:var(--color-error); padding:0.75rem;'>…</p>` as text.
    Markup belongs in a template. %>
<div role="status" aria-live="polite"
     style="background:var(--color-tint); border:1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
            border-radius:12px; padding:1rem; font-size:0.875rem; color:var(--color-sub);">
  <%= message %>
</div>
